                 ╭─ Tutorial 1/6 ─────────────────────────────────────────────–─×─╮
                 │ Welcome to TermOS                                              │
                 │                                                                │
                 │ TermOS is a desktop that lives in your terminal and works like │
                 │ tmux.                                                          │
                 │                                                                │
                 │ Almost everything starts with the prefix key C-b: press it,    │
                 │ let go, then press a command key. If you pause after C-b, a    │
                 │ panel lists every key.                                         │
                 │                                                                │
                 │ Ctrl+Space opens the command palette: type a few letters of    │
                 │ anything you want to do.                                       │
                 │                                                                │
                 │ Use → / n / Space for the next page, ← / p for the previous    │
                 │ one, q to close.                                               │
                 │                                                                │
                 │                                                                │
                 │ page 1/6   → next   ← back   q close                           │
                 ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯






